+- VERIFICATION: Twelve policy tests cover tables, 32/64 KiB, capped and overflowing BDP, relay bursts, all budget ceilings, pressure/lane/generation gates, exact lifecycle reconciliation, four repeated replenishments, 10,000 unknown/released-channel churn cycles, and 2,000 deterministic randomized transitions. One selected-adapter test covers all four classes. The full 519-test Swift suite passed with the existing 25 known unavailable-ReluxNIOSSH issues; strict recursive Swift format, core boundaries, diff check, and `swift build` exited 0.
 
