.temp/TASK-260715-3kimon/results-rework-02.md-50-- `UInt64.max` bandwidth/RTT saturates then clamps to `262144 B`; uncapped measurements equal their configured capped inputs.
.temp/TASK-260715-3kimon/results-rework-02.md-51-- Soft caps new initial windows at the configured 32 KiB candidate. Pressure withholds every adjustment and nonessential ordinary/bulk opens. Critical, rekeying, failed, closing, closed, stale generation, above-low-water, invalid outstanding credit, and insufficient reservation refuse without mutation or a pending side queue.
.temp/TASK-260715-3kimon/results-rework-02.md-52-- Configuration rejects non-32/64 candidates, missing classes, overflowing class capacity, inconsistent ceilings, and protocol windows above `UInt32.max`.
.temp/TASK-260715-3kimon/results-rework-02.md-53-
.temp/TASK-260715-3kimon/results-rework-02.md:54:Production adjustment gate: `SSHReceiveWindowBudgetLedger.reserveAdjustment` in `Sources/ReluxTunnelCore/SSHReceiveWindowBudgetPolicy.swift`. Production selected-adapter call sites: `LibSSH2Transport.performOpenDirectTCPIP` and `performOpenExecChannel`, both through `LibSSH2ChannelWindowAdapter.initialReceiveWindow`; engine-owned `WINDOW_ADJUST` remains explicitly unsupported.
